  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Expertise to the African Union 2024-2026 (NORCAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support civilian activities related to the African Union&apos;s work on peace, security and stability, governance and democracy, sustainable and inclusive development and to the AU&apos;s own institutional development. The impact of this project is expected to strengthen the ability and cpacity of the AUC to reach the ambitions and goals set in the second ten-year implementation plan (STYIP) of Agenda 2063.</narrative>
  </description>
